ceholder col-photo\">[Photo: 母女在雪地合影，穿彩色冬装]</div>\n      <div class=\"caption-small\">网络截图</div>\n      <p>[illegible]</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col4\">\n      <h4>冰雪赛事点燃热情</h4>\n      <p>近日，不少国际冰雪赛事在国内举办，让冰雪\"出口\"能够展现冰雪魅力和平昌意识。</p>\n      <p>[illegible]</p>\n      <div class=\"placeholder col-photo\" style=\"height:150px;\">[Photo: 冰雪赛事场地，运动员与人群]</div>\n      <div class=\"caption-small\">网络截图</div>\n      <p>[illegible]</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <hr class=\"divider\">\n\n  <div class=\"bottom-section\">\n    <div class=\"bottom-left\">\n      <h4>志愿服务温暖回家路</h4>\n      <div class=\"bottom-photos\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder bottom-photo\">[Photo: 志愿者合影，红色\"平安春运\"背景]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder bottom-photo\">[Photo: 志愿者与乘客在候车厅]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder bottom-photo\">[Photo: 志愿者协助乘客搬运行李]</div>\n      </div>\n      <p>[illegible]</p>\n      <p>[illegible]</p>\n      <p>亳秋、李峰蜡、王友际、守量敬谱摄影报道</p>\n      <p>[illegible]</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"bottom-right\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"height:110px;\">[Photo: 医护人员在病房内进行操作]</div>\n      <div class=\"title\">用专业与敬业守护生命</div>\n      <div class=\"byline\">李贞&nbsp;&nbsp;郭晓</div>\n      <p>[illegible]</p>\n      <p>[illegible]</p>\n      <p>[illegible]</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
